###> peyra/terraform ###
# infra/terraform/ runs from the operator's machine (docs/production.md). Its state holds the IAM
# user's secret key, its variables name the real bucket and profile: none of them is committed.
# The provider lock file (.terraform.lock.hcl) is, as Terraform asks.
/infra/terraform/.terraform/
/infra/terraform/*.tfstate
/infra/terraform/*.tfstate.*
/infra/terraform/.terraform.tfstate.lock.info
/infra/terraform/*.tfvars
!/infra/terraform/terraform.tfvars.example
/infra/terraform/*.tfplan
/infra/terraform/crash.log
/infra/terraform/crash.*.log
###< peyra/terraform ###
